<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge">
  <title>FySet</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Be+Vietnam+Pro:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  
  <style>
    body, table, td, a { -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; }
    table, td { mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; }
    img { -ms-interpolation-mode: bicubic; border: 0; outline: none; text-decoration: none; }
    body { margin: 0 !important; padding: 0 !important; width: 100% !important; background-color: #f3f5fb; font-family: 'Be Vietnam Pro', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; }
    
    .email-wrapper { width: 100%; background-color: #f3f5fb; padding: 40px 16px; }
    .email-card { max-width: 520px; margin: 0 auto; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid rgba(169, 183, 203, 0.4); box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08); overflow: hidden; }
    .email-header { padding: 32px 32px 24px 32px; text-align: center; border-bottom: 1px solid #eef1f5; }
    .logo-brand { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: #0950c3; text-decoration: none; letter-spacing: -0.025em; }
    .email-footer { background-color: #f8fafc; padding: 24px 32px; text-align: center; border-top: 1px solid #eef1f5; }
    .footer-text { font-size: 12px; color: #64748b; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0; }
    .footer-links { margin-top: 8px; font-size: 12px; }
    .footer-links a { color: #0950c3; text-decoration: none; margin: 0 8px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="email-wrapper">
    <table role="presentation" width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
      <tr>
        <td align="center">
          <div class="email-card">
            
            <div class="email-header">
              <a href="" class="logo-brand" target="_blank">
                ⚡ FYSET
              </a>
            </div>

            {{{body}}}

            <div class="email-footer">
              <p class="footer-text">
                Email này được gửi tự động từ hệ thống <strong>FySet</strong>.<br>
                Vui lòng không trực tiếp phản hồi lại email này.
              </p>
              <div class="footer-links">
                <a href="" target="_blank">Bảo mật</a> • 
                <a href="" target="_blank">Hỗ trợ</a>
              </div>
              <p class="footer-text" style="margin-top: 12px; font-size: 11px;">
                © 2026 FySet. Tất cả các quyền được bảo lưu.
              </p>
            </div>

          </div>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </div>
</body>
</html>